&P464380 = WZKM 104, 031-055 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _zi3-da mu-bi-im_ 
#tr.en: Flour, his name; 
2. _2(disz) sila3_ be-li2-qar-ra-ad _erin2 {gesz}gigir_ 
#tr.en: 2 sila3: Bēlī-qarrād, the charioteer, 
3. 2(disz) zi#-ik-ru-wa-ak-sze 
#tr.en: 2: Zikru-wakše, 
4. _1(ban2) 6(disz) erin2# nig2-szu_ bi-il-ta-ak-ni 
#tr.en: 1 ban2 6: troops under the command of Biltakni, 
$ (erasure) 
# erased qa2?-du? ... 
5. _1(ban2) 2(disz) erin2# nig2-szu_ szu-hu-ut-ki!(DI) 
#tr.en: 1 ban2 2: troops under the command of Šuḫutki, 
6. _2(ban2) 8(disz) erin2# nig2-szu_ pir-hi-i3-li2-szu 
#tr.en: 2 ban2 8: troops under the command of Pirḫi-ilišu, 
7. _1(ban2) 2(disz) erin2 nig2#-szu_ tu-ur-ma-lu-uk 
#tr.en: 1 ban2 2: troops under the command of Turmaluk, 
8. _2(ban2) 2(disz) sila3 erin2 nig2#-szu#_ a-wi-li-ia 
#tr.en: 2 ban2 2: troops under the command of Awīliya, 
$ (erasure) 
# erased qa2?-du? ... 
9. _erin2_ ka-asz-szu-u2 
#tr.en: Kassite troops; 
10. _2(disz) sila3_ i3-li2-i-qi2-sza 
#tr.en: 2 sila3: Ilī-iqīšam, 
11. 2(disz) a-wi-la#-tum 
#tr.en: 2: Awīlatum, 
12. 2(disz) nu-na#-a 
#tr.en: 2: Nūnāya, 
13. 2(disz) {d}suen-e-ri-isz 
#tr.en: 2: Sîn-ēriš, 
14. 2(disz) {d}suen-im-gur-an-ni 
#tr.en: 2: Sîn-imguranni, 
15. 2(disz) pir-hu#-um 
#tr.en: 2: Pirḫum, 
$ (erasures) 
# erased twice 2(disz) ... 
16. _erin2_ e-li a-ab-ba 
#tr.en: troops at sea;
17. li-tum {d}marduk#-na#-s,i-ir a-bi _erin2_ 
#tr.en: under the responsibility of Marduk-nāṣir, the abi-ṣābim official; 
18. _1(barig) 4(ban2)# 6(disz) sila3 zi3-da_ 
#tr.en: (subtotal): 1 barig 4 ban2 6 sila3 of flour, 
# calculation: 2 + 2 + 16 + 12 + 28 + 12 + 22 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 106 
19. _sa2-du11 u4 1(disz)-kam_ 
#tr.en: rations for one day, 
20. sza isz-tu# _iti gu4-si-sa2! u4 1(disz)-kam_ 
#tr.en: from month “gu-sisa,”  1st day, 
21. a#-di _u4 3(u)-kam_ sza _2(u) 9(disz) u4-mi_ 
#tr.en: until the 30th day, (a period) of 29 days 
22. isz-tu _u4 1(disz)-kam u4-da-gid2-da_ na-as2-hu 
#tr.en: by having one ‘longday’ day deducted; 
@reverse 
1. _1(u) 1(barig)# 1(ban2)# 4(disz)# sila3 sze gur_ 
#tr.en: (total): 10 gur 1 barig 1 ban2 4 sila3 of barley, 
# calculation: 106 × 29 = 10;1,1,4 
2. _{gesz}ba-ri2-ga_ {d}marduk sza nam-ha-ar-ti 
#tr.en: (measured by) the parsiktum-measure of Marduk for receipts 
3. szi-i#-iq# me-sze-qi2#-im bi-ru-ia-im 
#tr.en: according to the medium standard; 
4. a-na _sa2-du11 erin2#_ ka#-asz-szi-i _erin2 giri3 u3 erin2_ e-li a-ab-ba 
#tr.en: for the rations of the Kassite troops, the foot soldiers and the troops at sea, 
5. wa-szi#-ib babila2#{ki#} 
#tr.en: stationed at Babylon;
6. i-nu-ma# um-ma-na-tum 
#tr.en: when the troops 
7. it-ti {disz}{d}marduk#-na#-s,i#-ir# a-bi erin2# 
#tr.en: together with (i.e., under the command of) Marduk-nāṣir, the abi-ṣābim official. 
8. {disz}su-mu-ha-am-mu _gal# ukken#-na#_ {disz}dumu-zimbir{ki} _gal ukken-na_ 
#tr.en: Sūmû-ḫammu, the mu’errum-commander, Mār-Sippar, the mu’errum-commander, 
9. u3 szu-mu-li#-ib-szi _gal# ukken-na_ 
#tr.en: and Šumu-libši, the mu’errum-commander, 
10. i-na bad3-a-bi-e-szu-uh{ki} sza _kun! i7_ ha-am-mu-ra-pi2-nu-hu-usz-ni-szi 
#tr.en: at Dūr-Abī-ēšuḫ at the outlet of the Ḫammurāpi-nuḫuš-nišī canal
11. wa-asz-bu _lu2 1(disz)-e 1(barig) sze-ta_ 
#tr.en: were stationed; per 1 man 1 barig of barley each; 
12. a-na _szuku iti# gu4#-si-sa2#_ in-na-ad-nu-szu-nu-szi-im 
#tr.en: as rations for month “gu-sisa” it was given to them; 
13. _zi#-ga# sza3 sze gu2#-un hi#-a_ u3 _sze_ a-hi-a-tim 
#tr.en: expenditure out of the barley (paid as) various biltum-taxes and associated barley, 
14. sza a-na re-esz _szuku_ um-ma-na-tim# u3 _erin2#_ a-hi-a-tim 
#tr.en: that the rationing of the troops and associated workers 
15. ku-ul-li#-im 
#tr.en: supported, 
16. a#-na# bad3-a-bi-e#-szu#-uh{ki} sza _kun i7_ ha-am-mu-ra-pi2-nu-hu-usz-ni-szi 
#tr.en: to Dūr-Abī-ēšuḫ at the outlet of the Ḫammurāpi-nuḫuš-nišī canal 
17. ib-ba-ab-lam 
#tr.en: has been brought; 
18. _nig2-szu_ a-wi-il-{d}utu u3 {d}suen-u2-se-el-li _sza3-tam-mesz_ 
#tr.en: under the command of Awīl-Šamaš and Sîn-uselli, the accountants, 
19. a-na _nig2-ka9#_-szu-nu isz-sza-ak-ka-an 
#tr.en: (the flour) to their accounts has been set; 
20. szu a-wi-il-{d}utu u3 {d#}suen#-u2-se-el-li# 
#tr.en: (via) Awīl-Šamaš and Sîn-uselli; 
